        "rbtv-sb-\n"
        "                    ┃  merge-refactor/build/kg-views-rebuild read toolsmith-2\n"
        "                    ┃\n"
        "                    ┃  Build · DeepSeek Reasoner DeepSeek\n"
        "                    ╹▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀"
        "▀▀▀▀▀▀\n"
